MITRE ATT&CK® groups and campaigns (OpenCRQ Default Threats dataset)
================================================================================

Fetched by the OpenCRQ Default Threats connector when it runs; not shipped with OpenCRQ.

The OpenCRQ datasets repository, https://github.com/OpenCRQ-Platform/datasets, copyright 2026
Filigran, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The connector reads its Default Threats
file, under data/, and stores what it holds as threats.

